WEBVTT

00:00:05.430 --> 00:00:09.160
My brother will stop at nothing to prevent the contract.

00:00:09.490 --> 00:00:13.150
Interaction between handlers and demons can only bring misfortune.

00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:14.520
No!

00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:17.570
Let Tomoharu go.

00:00:20.650 --> 00:00:21.550
Takatsuki.

00:00:22.240 --> 00:00:24.010
I'm sorry.

00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:25.790
Takatsuki.

00:00:31.010 --> 00:00:32.710
We need that trunk, Tomo.

00:00:37.240 --> 00:00:37.780
Misao!

00:00:45.820 --> 00:00:46.660
I need that.

00:00:55.990 --> 00:01:03.580
<i>Asura Cryin'</i>

00:02:17.080 --> 00:02:20.490
"The Shadow of Science"

00:02:26.610 --> 00:02:27.630
Guess who.

00:02:29.220 --> 00:02:31.580
W-what's wrong with you?

00:02:31.870 --> 00:02:34.010
Did you forget me?

00:02:34.220 --> 00:02:37.520
No, I meant what are you doing in my house?

00:02:38.860 --> 00:02:42.010
You don't know how to use an Asura Machina.

00:02:42.410 --> 00:02:43.100
Right?

00:02:45.020 --> 00:02:47.010
It's the same as the first time you opened the trunk.

00:02:47.270 --> 00:02:49.550
You simply command it to come out.

00:02:50.240 --> 00:02:51.830
What are you talking about?

00:02:52.230 --> 00:02:54.040
I've got a sense of the situation.

00:02:54.850 --> 00:02:55.850
"Club Application"

00:02:55.130 --> 00:02:57.990
I'll save you if you'll join the Science Club.

00:02:58.420 --> 00:02:59.440
I don't have time for jokes.

00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:01.680
I'm being serious.

00:03:02.160 --> 00:03:04.690
Adults need just cause.

00:03:04.910 --> 00:03:08.500
I don't have time for chit-chat.

00:03:08.750 --> 00:03:09.620
Get out of the way.

00:03:10.600 --> 00:03:11.540
Oh, right.

00:03:11.830 --> 00:03:14.650
Kanade's going to go on trial...

00:03:14.650 --> 00:03:15.780
...but it's just a formality.

00:03:16.030 --> 00:03:17.550
She'll be executed right away.

00:03:35.700 --> 00:03:37.040
Stupid.

00:03:37.480 --> 00:03:39.220
Why didn't you take a taxi?

00:03:58.350 --> 00:03:59.070
Hey.

00:04:00.770 --> 00:04:02.620
Where's Misao?

00:04:04.180 --> 00:04:06.100
Don't tell me they got her.

00:04:07.620 --> 00:04:09.140
That's what happened.

00:04:13.820 --> 00:04:16.030
I guess you don't have to worry.

00:04:16.280 --> 00:04:18.600
She's a ghost.

00:04:18.600 --> 00:04:20.590
How can you be so cruel?

00:04:21.530 --> 00:04:24.250
Misao could never sit still.

00:04:24.580 --> 00:04:27.400
She spoke without thinking.

00:04:27.690 --> 00:04:30.080
Always getting involved in everybody's business.

00:04:30.590 --> 00:04:33.020
But nothing like that had ever happened to her.

00:04:33.820 --> 00:04:35.450
So you want revenge?

00:04:36.860 --> 00:04:39.000
Don't you have emotions?

00:04:40.160 --> 00:04:45.010
It would be pretty dangerous for you to call on the Asura Machina without Misao.

00:04:45.590 --> 00:04:47.150
Leave me be.

00:05:03.780 --> 00:05:06.020
That's the Student Union's mark.

00:05:06.460 --> 00:05:08.050
I can tell by looking.

00:05:08.960 --> 00:05:10.300
What do they want?

00:05:10.520 --> 00:05:12.580
Maybe they're here for Shiro.

00:05:13.200 --> 00:05:14.580
The Student Union?

00:05:15.260 --> 00:05:16.420
Give me some.

00:05:18.010 --> 00:05:19.280
Get your own.

00:05:20.590 --> 00:05:21.780
Shiro!

00:05:28.090 --> 00:05:29.210
What are you doing?

00:05:29.570 --> 00:05:32.220
It doesn't matter. He's just your brother.

00:05:32.540 --> 00:05:33.560
You're terrible!

00:05:46.020 --> 00:05:47.070
W-what?

00:05:59.900 --> 00:06:00.800
A daughter.

00:06:01.240 --> 00:06:02.720
She must be after that.

00:06:12.470 --> 00:06:13.190
Reishiro.

00:06:13.810 --> 00:06:14.970
Where is Miss Takatsuki?

00:06:15.370 --> 00:06:16.630
She's locked up.

00:06:17.180 --> 00:06:18.950
What do you intend to do to her?

00:06:19.390 --> 00:06:21.630
According to procedure, we will hold a trial.

00:06:22.180 --> 00:06:23.840
Couldn't you just expel her from school?

00:06:24.350 --> 00:06:29.600
She attacked the First Student Council responsible for protecting the school's safety.

00:06:29.970 --> 00:06:33.370
On top of that, her motive was saving Natsume Tomoharu.

00:06:36.740 --> 00:06:40.620
Reiko, our duty is divine and absolute.

00:06:41.410 --> 00:06:43.010
Don't forget that.

00:06:46.120 --> 00:06:47.650
I have never forgotten.

00:07:01.230 --> 00:07:02.610
Hurry, Reiko.

00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:05.800
Hurry, you two.

00:07:17.350 --> 00:07:19.710
If anything had been slightly different that day...

00:07:20.110 --> 00:07:23.330
...Aine could have been the one standing here.

00:07:26.270 --> 00:07:28.870
Where are you, Takatsuki?

00:07:32.140 --> 00:07:34.380
Demons are dangerous.

00:07:37.710 --> 00:07:40.500
Where is Takatsuki?

00:07:40.940 --> 00:07:45.290
Are you willing to hurt Misao to save a demon?

00:07:46.370 --> 00:07:47.420
Please don't do it.

00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:49.380
For the sake of Misao as well.

00:07:49.670 --> 00:07:50.650
Don't be ridiculous.

00:07:51.050 --> 00:07:52.530
You're the ones that hurt Misao.

00:07:53.150 --> 00:07:54.810
Do not worry.

00:07:55.430 --> 00:07:57.310
Misao will return to you soon.

00:07:57.460 --> 00:07:58.730
Don't say that.

00:07:59.160 --> 00:08:00.180
It's true.

00:08:00.180 --> 00:08:01.770
You can't expect me to believe that.

00:08:02.170 --> 00:08:04.740
Please help Reishiro.

00:08:05.430 --> 00:08:07.710
I want you to use your power for good.

00:08:08.180 --> 00:08:09.710
Where is Takatsuki?

00:08:09.990 --> 00:08:12.130
You must forget about her.

00:08:12.600 --> 00:08:14.160
If you and she...

00:08:14.270 --> 00:08:15.070
Where is she?

00:08:20.830 --> 00:08:21.660
There.

00:08:22.530 --> 00:08:24.990
I did not wish to fight you.

00:08:25.570 --> 00:08:27.380
I didn't want this either.

00:08:27.960 --> 00:08:29.450
But I have to go.

00:08:35.210 --> 00:08:36.480
Hang in there, Aine.

00:08:36.800 --> 00:08:37.490
Aine!

00:08:39.560 --> 00:08:41.300
You'll be fine. I'll save you.

00:08:51.660 --> 00:08:52.780
Don't worry about me.

00:08:53.430 --> 00:08:55.530
You need help, don't you?

00:09:05.140 --> 00:09:08.110
Demons bring nothing but misfortune.

00:09:08.760 --> 00:09:11.660
Such creatures cannot be allowed to exist.

00:09:13.320 --> 00:09:16.370
But you are far more dangerous than them.

00:09:16.980 --> 00:09:21.580
The power created by a contract between you and Tomoharu Natsume...

00:09:21.870 --> 00:09:23.970
...would turn this world into hell.

00:09:24.520 --> 00:09:28.650
I won't let you create such evil.

00:09:29.260 --> 00:09:31.510
It doesn't matter what happens to me.

00:09:32.200 --> 00:09:35.600
Please leave Tomoharu alone.

00:09:36.470 --> 00:09:40.820
Tomoharu does not think anything of me.

00:09:41.150 --> 00:09:44.010
So please, leave him alone.

00:09:44.150 --> 00:09:46.010
I don't listen to demons.

00:09:46.360 --> 00:09:47.560
Kanade Takatsuki.

00:09:47.700 --> 00:09:50.460
Go back to hell.

00:09:59.410 --> 00:10:00.200
Don't move!

00:10:01.540 --> 00:10:02.920
Tomoharu!

00:10:03.900 --> 00:10:04.590
Don't move.

00:10:05.130 --> 00:10:06.980
I'll open it!

00:10:08.320 --> 00:10:09.950
Are you okay, Takatsuki?

00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:12.700
Let's go. Hurry!

00:10:13.320 --> 00:10:14.190
Why?

00:10:15.310 --> 00:10:16.980
Why did you come?

00:10:17.410 --> 00:10:18.610
What are you talking about?

00:10:19.120 --> 00:10:21.870
It's my fault you're involved in this mess.

00:10:22.270 --> 00:10:23.570
That's not true.

00:10:23.790 --> 00:10:24.910
Yes, it is.

00:10:25.200 --> 00:10:27.300
It's because I'm a demon.

00:10:27.700 --> 00:10:31.000
You're really wearing out your welcome, Tomoharu Natsume.

00:10:31.430 --> 00:10:32.120
Don't move.

00:10:32.480 --> 00:10:35.530
Coming to die for a demon. How foolish.

00:10:36.030 --> 00:10:37.300
Why do you keep calling her a demon?

00:10:38.030 --> 00:10:40.060
She's just an ordinary girl.

00:10:41.760 --> 00:10:43.030
I understand.

00:10:44.980 --> 00:10:46.180
Stop! Don't move!

00:10:46.830 --> 00:10:49.040
You'll die with her.

00:10:49.620 --> 00:10:50.780
I'll open it!

00:10:51.610 --> 00:10:52.120
Do it.

00:10:59.470 --> 00:11:00.450
Come out!

00:11:04.180 --> 00:11:04.550
Huh?

00:11:09.690 --> 00:11:11.000
A club application?

00:11:11.250 --> 00:11:13.890
What did she do this time?

00:11:14.180 --> 00:11:14.800
Fire!

00:11:18.310 --> 00:11:18.930
Can you run?

00:11:21.650 --> 00:11:22.150
Run!

00:11:38.460 --> 00:11:39.620
This ends now.

00:11:40.340 --> 00:11:42.800
And to keep this from happening ever again...

00:11:43.170 --> 00:11:44.330
...let's live together.

00:11:46.720 --> 00:11:47.550
I'm sorry.

00:11:57.770 --> 00:11:59.870
Damn, it's locked.

00:12:00.160 --> 00:12:00.810
Have you seen them?

00:12:00.810 --> 00:12:01.280
No.

00:12:01.680 --> 00:12:02.440
Check the halls.

00:12:02.690 --> 00:12:04.400
Block all exits!

00:12:04.900 --> 00:12:06.720
You've got nowhere to run.

00:12:07.080 --> 00:12:08.060
Senpai!

00:12:08.060 --> 00:12:09.030
Hi.

00:12:09.360 --> 00:12:12.190
What did you do to the trunk?

00:12:12.400 --> 00:12:14.140
I put a club application in it.

00:12:14.400 --> 00:12:16.460
That's not what I meant.

00:12:16.750 --> 00:12:18.600
Hurry up and sign it.

00:12:19.030 --> 00:12:20.190
Don't you need help?

00:12:20.520 --> 00:12:21.790
Not this again.

00:12:23.670 --> 00:12:25.300
Unlock the door. Hurry!

00:12:25.990 --> 00:12:26.970
See?

00:12:27.480 --> 00:12:29.030
You'll be riddled with bullets.

00:12:30.370 --> 00:12:31.420
Tomoharu.

00:12:32.690 --> 00:12:33.710
Damn it.

00:12:36.860 --> 00:12:37.910
Tomoharu?

00:12:38.450 --> 00:12:39.650
I don't have anything to write with.

00:12:42.180 --> 00:12:43.020
That's...

00:12:43.630 --> 00:12:47.110
Right. It's probably a pen of some kind.

00:12:47.800 --> 00:12:48.630
I'll open it.

00:12:52.400 --> 00:12:52.980
What?

00:12:53.340 --> 00:12:56.780
My father's gifts are always knives.

00:13:05.810 --> 00:13:06.640
If you don't mind...

00:13:08.600 --> 00:13:10.520
Th-thank you.

00:13:14.970 --> 00:13:16.060
Kurosaki!

00:13:33.380 --> 00:13:34.390
Go on.

00:13:37.690 --> 00:13:40.260
I can't promise you'll live through this one.

00:13:41.420 --> 00:13:41.960
Retreat.

00:13:42.540 --> 00:13:43.160
Sir!

00:13:43.850 --> 00:13:46.740
You'll hold Hisui back.

00:13:56.420 --> 00:13:57.830
Asura Cryin'.

00:14:03.920 --> 00:14:05.690
I will nip this misfortune in the bud.

00:14:37.610 --> 00:14:38.330
What is that?

00:14:49.350 --> 00:14:50.000
Tomoharu.

00:14:50.580 --> 00:14:51.630
Let's go, Takatsuki.

00:14:53.040 --> 00:14:53.770
Hisui!

00:15:04.890 --> 00:15:05.800
Kurosaki!

00:15:09.020 --> 00:15:10.040
Are you hurt?

00:15:10.140 --> 00:15:10.580
No.

00:15:22.430 --> 00:15:24.310
Don't you ever give up?

00:15:26.410 --> 00:15:28.510
Let's hurry. I'm out of ammunition.

00:15:37.100 --> 00:15:38.840
T-Takatsuki.

00:15:39.340 --> 00:15:41.630
Crush them, Hisui.

00:15:43.660 --> 00:15:46.010
We cannot allow another to be born.

00:16:04.420 --> 00:16:06.230
No!

00:16:16.330 --> 00:16:17.750
Asura Machina?

00:16:18.290 --> 00:16:19.020
Why?

00:16:35.030 --> 00:16:37.020
You don't need the trunk any more.

00:16:37.600 --> 00:16:39.630
Kurogane is with you now.

00:16:40.030 --> 00:16:42.170
Responding to Hisui again, I see.

00:16:42.600 --> 00:16:43.980
Freeze it, Hisui!

00:16:52.530 --> 00:16:57.740
Stay there until a worthy handler comes for you, Kurogane.

00:16:59.520 --> 00:17:02.130
From the abyss deeper than darkness.

00:17:02.780 --> 00:17:03.470
What?

00:17:05.030 --> 00:17:05.680
It is...

00:17:06.370 --> 00:17:08.320
...the shadow cast by the light of science.

00:17:13.690 --> 00:17:15.210
Impossible.

00:17:30.790 --> 00:17:31.580
Stop.

00:17:32.600 --> 00:17:33.580
Please stop!

00:17:33.760 --> 00:17:35.310
You'll kill Aine!

00:17:39.840 --> 00:17:41.800
What is a projection body?

00:17:44.190 --> 00:17:47.230
Something like a living spirit.

00:17:47.600 --> 00:17:50.570
It's the sacrifice bound inside an Asura Machina.

00:17:50.570 --> 00:17:51.440
Sacrifice?

00:17:51.440 --> 00:17:52.410
Human sacrifice.

00:17:52.600 --> 00:17:55.490
Stop!

00:18:00.100 --> 00:18:01.000
Misao!

00:18:01.180 --> 00:18:04.040
Stop it!

00:18:29.010 --> 00:18:29.880
Misao.

00:18:30.200 --> 00:18:31.320
Where am I?

00:18:31.510 --> 00:18:33.750
You're... okay?

00:18:34.260 --> 00:18:35.750
Nothing's wrong?

00:18:36.900 --> 00:18:38.530
I had a bad dream.

00:18:39.010 --> 00:18:43.460
You got trapped by that weird student council president and crushed.

00:18:43.930 --> 00:18:44.980
What a relief.

00:18:45.780 --> 00:18:46.870
What are you saying?

00:18:47.270 --> 00:18:48.680
Did you hit your head?

00:18:50.740 --> 00:18:52.370
I think I may have.

00:18:59.220 --> 00:19:02.120
That settles it, Reishiro.

00:19:02.740 --> 00:19:03.860
Settles it?

00:19:04.870 --> 00:19:05.740
That's...!

00:19:06.070 --> 00:19:07.920
I'm sure you haven't forgotten.

00:19:09.400 --> 00:19:13.640
The Science Club controls the Third Student Council Royal Dark Society...

00:19:14.440 --> 00:19:20.340
Just as the Vatican commands your Holy Guard to eliminate demons within school grounds...

00:19:20.740 --> 00:19:24.800
...the Dark Society is tasked with protecting demons within school grounds.

00:19:25.310 --> 00:19:30.230
By our patron her majesty, Chair of the National Religion Committee.

00:19:30.520 --> 00:19:33.310
Do you even realize what you've done, Kurosaki?

00:19:34.000 --> 00:19:35.520
Go ahead and threaten me.

00:19:35.780 --> 00:19:36.610
You're too late.

00:19:37.120 --> 00:19:40.670
Or perhaps you'd like to start a war with us?

00:19:44.940 --> 00:19:48.670
Fine. They're your responsibility now.

00:19:49.140 --> 00:19:52.770
But if they do anything to cross the line again...

00:19:53.020 --> 00:19:56.030
...the Royal Guard will go after them with full force.

00:19:56.280 --> 00:19:57.800
Even if it means war.

00:20:01.720 --> 00:20:05.300
You've made a foolish decision, Tomoharu Natsume.

00:20:07.190 --> 00:20:09.470
I'll be watching you.

00:20:09.690 --> 00:20:11.240
Don't forget it.

00:20:12.880 --> 00:20:15.160
Thank you for saving Aine.

00:20:15.740 --> 00:20:18.960
Take that demon and get out of my sight.

00:20:31.610 --> 00:20:34.320
Senpai, is Misao also...?

00:20:40.770 --> 00:20:42.000
Oh, that's right.

00:20:42.330 --> 00:20:43.270
Here. Take this.

00:20:44.580 --> 00:20:47.840
Hey! That's my house key!

00:20:47.940 --> 00:20:49.360
Why do you have that?

00:20:49.650 --> 00:20:51.680
Oh, didn't I tell you?

00:20:52.150 --> 00:20:55.230
The Science Club has been using the Meiotei for years.

00:20:55.440 --> 00:20:58.050
It was chosen by our founder Mr. Naotaka.

00:20:58.600 --> 00:20:59.970
My brother again?

00:21:00.230 --> 00:21:05.120
Feel free to come and go as you please.

00:21:06.460 --> 00:21:08.850
Hey, wait. Uh...

00:21:09.140 --> 00:21:10.300
What?

00:21:10.480 --> 00:21:13.340
Misao can stay there, but we can't?

00:21:13.740 --> 00:21:16.060
Are you two doing something you need to hide from others?

00:21:16.060 --> 00:21:17.440
Of course not!

00:21:17.650 --> 00:21:19.720
Then it shouldn't be a problem.

00:21:21.670 --> 00:21:22.720
See? It's okay.

00:21:28.200 --> 00:21:29.540
It's beautiful!

00:21:38.590 --> 00:21:39.210
What?

00:21:43.560 --> 00:21:46.130
If she's still alive, there must be a way.

00:21:46.930 --> 00:21:49.280
A way to save her.

00:23:20.040 --> 00:23:25.580
"Preview"

00:23:20.870 --> 00:23:21.920
It is loneliness.

00:23:22.320 --> 00:23:23.480
It is rage.

00:23:23.660 --> 00:23:26.010
The reason for the tears is the cry of the soul.

00:23:26.160 --> 00:23:27.930
Wandering, exhausted.

00:23:28.110 --> 00:23:29.530
To the point you forget yourself.

00:23:29.640 --> 00:23:31.370
Why? What should I do?

00:23:31.960 --> 00:23:35.060
"Thoughts with Nowhere to Go"
